      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T10:58:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a facility here to separate the contents of individual BUILD files in the hasher?\n\nAFAICT this code here only adds the raw contents of the BUILD files, which can fail in a number of ways:\n\n1. the same BUILD file generated at a different path will have the same hash, even though it means something else for Bazel\n2. a single BUILD file containing \"foobar\" will have the same hash as two BUILD files containing \"foo\" and \"bar\", respectively",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 129,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 129,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "2b8c490a8cb6ca891fb43bafe7027a87ae77fe35",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
